  "description": "“I’ll take you to the northern city!”\n\nIn a world where winter never ends, Dawn is a girl who runs errands in an alley town. The driving force behind Dawn's survival is only because of her promise with the delivery person, Heather. Let’s go to ‘Northern City’, a place of hope where everything happens! Dawn, who meets Heather again, thinks there is only happiness left in the future, but things start to get more and more strange...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854757), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14697626)",
